35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The weather lost us six weeks. The older blocks have hazards.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"Specialist rooms are idle, but general rooms are always full.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,Technicians are doing manual checks because the equipment is old.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
