39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Mechanical costs rose by a fifth. No reserve for old AV kit.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, does the cost rise affect the ventilation plan?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
