47,2,3,talk,George,,The lab upgrade requires more manual labor from our staff.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"The media center might be idle, like the specialist rooms.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The path network costs are stable, unlike the mechanical lots.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I lean towards the path network. It is safer.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I support the study commons. It solves the booking issue.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
